{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     First, approach visible object. If none, scan area. Then, do specific task or move, and repeat.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToSpecifiedLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = GoToNextLocation    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />",
